{"role": "user", "content": "请按可见标签选择 REAGENT A（R01 试剂瓶），将其中的试剂一次性倒入 BEAKER，倾倒时保持瓶口对准 BEAKER 瓶口，完成后将试剂瓶放回原位。倾倒参数由你决定：倾倒角度请在 0.8-1.2 rad 内选择，保持时间 2.0 秒，不要向用户反问，直接执行到任务终态。", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T10:18:53.464870"}
{"role": "assistant", "content": "我将按可见标签选择 REAGENT A（R01），采用 1.0 rad 倾倒角度、保持 2.0 秒，并在瓶口对准 BEAKER 开口的条件下完成倾倒和原位放回。本环境无液体模型，因此只报告运行时确认的模拟动作结果，不报告实际转移体积。\n", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_39aa921c8d094e5f9a9618f66764dcc3", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "forge_task_create", "arguments": "{\"task_description\": \"按可见标签选择 REAGENT A（R01 试剂瓶），一次性向 BEAKER 倾倒，倾倒期间保持瓶口对准 BEAKER 开口，倾倒角度 1.0 rad，保持 2.0 秒，完成后试剂瓶放回原位。执行至任务终态；仅报告无液体模拟中的实测操作结果。\", \"semantic_subtasks\": [{\"subtask_id\": \"pour_reagent_a_into_beaker\", \"operation\": \"pour\", \"source_category\": \"reagent_bottle\", \"source_selector\": {\"label\": \"REAGENT A\", \"id\": \"R01\"}, \"destination_category\": \"mixing_vessel\", \"destination_selector\": {\"label\": \"BEAKER\"}, \"max_age_ms\": 1000, \"sensor_refs\": [\"sensor://tabletop_third_person\"], \"parameters\": {\"tilt_rad\": 1, \"hold_s\": 2}, \"semantic_intent\": {\"allowed_arms\": [\"franka\"], \"coordination_mode\": \"single_arm\", \"goal\": \"通过可见标签识别 REAGENT A（R01），拾取后一次性向 BEAKER 倾倒，倾倒时保持瓶口对准 BEAKER 开口，随后将试剂瓶放回原位。\", \"success_criteria\": [\"Runtime confirms acquisition of label-selected REAGENT A (R01).\", \"Runtime confirms a single pour with tilt_rad=1.0 and hold_s=2.0 while bottle mouth is aligned to BEAKER opening.\", \"Runtime confirms return of reagent bottle to its original location.\"], \"constraints\": [\"Keep bottle mouth aligned with BEAKER opening during pour.\", \"Return source bottle to its original location.\", \"No liquid-volume or chemical-quality claims.\"]}}], \"verification\": {\"mode\": \"off\"}}"}}], "reasoning_content": "**正在确认可用的匹配能力**", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T10:18:53.464877"}
