{"role": "assistant", "content": "首次标签绑定未找到唯一匹配项。我将去掉可能不受支持的附加编号筛选，仅使用可见标签“REAGENT A”重新绑定；不会按瓶子的固定位置推断身份。\n", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_81a91102af8b4538a55a1bb42cbeedd2", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "forge_task_create", "arguments": "{\"task_description\": \"按可见标签选择 REAGENT A（用户称 R01 试剂瓶），向 BEAKER 一次性倾倒，倾倒期间保持瓶口对准 BEAKER 开口，倾倒角度 1.0 rad，保持 2.0 秒，完成后放回原位。执行至任务终态，仅报告无液体模拟实测动作。\", \"semantic_subtasks\": [{\"subtask_id\": \"pour_reagent_a_into_beaker\", \"operation\": \"pour\", \"source_category\": \"reagent_bottle\", \"source_selector\": {\"label\": \"REAGENT A\"}, \"destination_category\": \"mixing_vessel\", \"destination_selector\": {\"label\": \"BEAKER\"}, \"max_age_ms\": 1000, \"sensor_refs\": [\"sensor://tabletop_third_person\"], \"parameters\": {\"tilt_rad\": 1, \"hold_s\": 2}, \"semantic_intent\": {\"allowed_arms\": [\"franka\"], \"coordination_mode\": \"single_arm\", \"goal\": \"Acquire visible-label REAGENT A (R01), perform a single pour into visible-label BEAKER keeping bottle mouth aligned with vessel opening, then return source bottle to original location.\", \"success_criteria\": [\"Runtime confirms acquisition of REAGENT A selected by visible label.\", \"Runtime confirms single pour with tilt_rad=1.0 and hold_s=2.0 with bottle mouth aligned to BEAKER opening.\", \"Runtime confirms source bottle returned to original location.\"], \"constraints\": [\"Keep bottle mouth aligned with BEAKER opening during pour.\", \"Return bottle to original location.\", \"Report measured no-liquid simulation only.\"]}}], \"verification\": {\"mode\": \"off\"}}"}}], "reasoning_content": "**Retrying REAGENT A selector**", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T10:18:53.464895"}
